.TH aozora-lsp 1  "aozora-lsp 0.4.1 (aozora a53c632 / v0.4.1)" 
.SH NAME
aozora\-lsp \- Language Server for aozora\-flavored\-markdown (speaks LSP over stdio)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBaozora\-lsp\fR [\fB\-\-stdio\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Language Server for aozora\-flavored\-markdown. Speaks LSP over stdio: stdout carries the JSON\-RPC wire protocol and logs go to stderr.
.PP
Environment variables:
  RUST_LOG                  tracing filter, e.g. `aozora_lsp=debug` (default: warn).
  AOZORA_LSP_SLOW_PARSE_US  per\-parse latency in microseconds above which a slow\-parse warning is logged (default: 100000).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stdio\fR
Speak LSP over stdio. Accepted for editor compatibility; this is the only supported transport, so the flag is a no\-op
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.4.1 (aozora a53c632 / v0.4.1)
